{
  "id": "copper_tubes___maximum_water_velocities",
  "title": "Copper Tubes - Maximum Water Velocities",
  "description": "Water velocity in a copper tube should not exceed certain limits to avoid erosion. This tool helps determine safe water velocity limits based on water temperature and system type.",
  "type": "calculator-chart",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Water Velocity Limits by System Type\n\nThe water velocity in a copper tube should be kept within certain limits to avoid erosion, corrosion and excessive noise generation.\n\n### Velocity Limits:\n\n* **Cold water systems**: Maximum 8 feet per second (2.4 m/s)\n* **Hot water systems (below 140°F / 60°C)**: Maximum 5 feet per second (1.5 m/s)\n* **Hot water systems (above 140°F / 60°C)**: Maximum 2 feet per second (0.6 m/s)\n\n**Note**: Local velocities in small tubes, bends and similar obstructions may exceed these values."
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "water_temperature",
          "label": "Water Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 60,
          "unit": "°C"
        },
        {
          "id": "system_type",
          "label": "System Type",
          "type": "select",
          "defaultValue": "cold",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Cold Water",
              "value": "cold"
            },
            {
              "label": "Hot Water",
              "value": "hot"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "flow_rate",
          "label": "Flow Rate",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 10,
          "unit": "L/min"
        },
        {
          "id": "tube_diameter",
          "label": "Copper Tube Diameter",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.5,
          "unit": "inches"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "max_velocity_ms",
          "label": "Maximum Allowed Velocity",
          "formula": "inputs.system_type === 'cold' ? 2.4 : (inputs.water_temperature < 60 ? 1.5 : 0.6)",
          "unit": "m/s",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "max_velocity_fts",
          "label": "Maximum Allowed Velocity",
          "formula": "inputs.system_type === 'cold' ? 8 : (inputs.water_temperature < 60 ? 5 : 2)",
          "unit": "ft/s",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "actual_velocity_ms",
          "label": "Actual Water Velocity",
          "formula": "(inputs.flow_rate / 60000) / (3.14159 * Math.pow(inputs.tube_diameter * 0.0127 / 2, 2))",
          "unit": "m/s",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "velocity_status",
          "label": "Velocity Status",
          "formula": "(inputs.system_type === 'cold' ? 2.4 : (inputs.water_temperature < 60 ? 1.5 : 0.6)) >= ((inputs.flow_rate / 60000) / (3.14159 * Math.pow(inputs.tube_diameter * 0.0127 / 2, 2))) ? 'Safe' : 'Exceeds Limit'",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chart",
      "headers": [
        "System Type",
        "Temperature Range",
        "Max Velocity (m/s)",
        "Max Velocity (ft/s)"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Cold Water",
          "Any",
          2.4,
          8
        ],
        [
          "Hot Water",
          "Below 60°C (140°F)",
          1.5,
          5
        ],
        [
          "Hot Water",
          "Above 60°C (140°F)",
          0.6,
          2
        ]
      ],
      "options": {
        "xAxis": {
          "type": "category",
          "data": [
            "Cold Water",
            "Hot Water (Below 60°C)",
            "Hot Water (Above 60°C)"
          ]
        },
        "yAxis": {
          "type": "value",
          "name": "Maximum Velocity (m/s)"
        },
        "series": [
          {
            "data": [
              2.4,
              1.5,
              0.6
            ],
            "type": "bar",
            "name": "Max Velocity (m/s)"
          }
        ],
        "tooltip": {
          "trigger": "axis"
        },
        "legend": {
          "data": [
            "Max Velocity (m/s)"
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}